// Article 3. Violations and fines: notice, a hearing, a finding, and only then a fine.
#require "1-association.charter".
Param maximum-fine = $100.00
Fact violation
Evidenced Fact committed Identified by owner * violation
Fact notified Identified by owner * violation
Fact answer Identified by Yes, No

Act give-notice Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation
  Holds when True
  Creates notified(owner, violation)
Finding hear Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation, answer
  Decides committed(owner, violation) When answer == Yes
  Valid when Held(notified(owner, violation)) For 10 days
Power fine Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation, amount : USD
  Valid when committed(owner, violation) && amount <= maximum-fine
  Creates fine-due(owner, association, violation, amount)
Duty fine-due Holder owner Claimant association Related to violation, amount : USD
  Due within 30 days
  Terminated by pay-fine
Act pay-fine Actor owner Recipient association Related to violation, amount : USD

Clause 3.1 => give-notice, hear, fine
Clause 3.2/1 => give-notice, notified
Clause 3.2/2 => hear
Clause 3.3 => committed, hear
Clause 3.4 => maximum-fine, fine
Clause 3.5 => fine-due, pay-fine.
